  "details": "1. Have a WMR headset\n\n2. Open VRChat\n\n3. Be stuck on open hands/closed eyes gesture because that's the default state now and WMR controllers don't have touch-sensitive buttons to bind the neutal gesture to\n\nNot actually a \"bug\" per se, but a definite design oversight that has been really ruining my VRC experience lately. I've read the docs and messed around with bindings but I cannot find a work around for this",
